https://api.github.com/users/yannick-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yannick-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yannick-b/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yannick-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yannick-b/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yannick-b/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yannick-b/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yannick-b/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yannick-b/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-zip-compressed","state":"uploaded","size":22054912,"digest":"sha256:7429cadd954a26596e49e6f7ab6831173d2becf7760ac0a3c8bb422c8d190092","download_count":259,"created_at":"2026-09-25T17:11:12Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T17:14:15Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/septadev/GTFS/releases/download/v202609270/gtfs_public.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/septadev/GTFS/tarball/v202609270","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/septadev/GTFS/zipball/v202609270","body":"### v202609270\r\n\r\n**Bus/Metro**\r\n\r\n*Authoritative (dates in feed_info.txt): 2026-09-27 through 2027-02-20*\\\r\n*Advisory only (dates in calendar.txt & calendar_dates.txt): N/A*\r\n* Minor adjustments to stop names and locations to bring GTFS into alignment with physical signage. Further adjustments will be made in future feeds.\r\n* Minor schedule adjustments to Route 60.\r\n* \"NOR Bus\" provides shuttle bus service for the Norristown Line (Regional Rail, not Metro route M1) between Conshohocken and Norristown - Elm St (serving Main St and Norristown Transit Center) on Oct. 3-4, Oct. 10-11, and Nov. 7-8. See septa.org for more information.\r\n\r\n**Regional Rail**\r\n\r\n*Authoritative (dates in feed_info.txt): 2026-09-06 through 2026-10-17*\\\r\n*Advisory only (dates in calendar.txt & calendar_dates.txt): 2026-10-17 through 2026-11-21*\r\n* Norristown Line does not serve Norristown Transit Center, Main St, or Norristown - Elm St on Oct. 3-4, Oct. 10-11, or Nov. 7-8 for a PECO wire project. See septa.org for more information. \r\n* Wilmington Line does not serve Wilmington on Oct. 17-18 or Oct. 24-25 due to Amtrak work. See septa.org for more information. \r\n* New schedules for CHE, FOX, LAN, MED, NOR, PAO, WAR, WIL, and WTR take effect on Oct. 18. (Schedules for AIR, CHW, CYN, and TRE will not change.) See septa.org for more information."}